    <string name="about">"About"</string>
    <string name="about_message">"Keep it simple. Enjoy watching.\n\nOriginal animated wallpapers · MIT License\nWeather: Open-Meteo / CC BY 4.0\nIP location: ipwho.is · approximate city\nCity search: GeoNames\nPhotos stay on this TV and are never uploaded.\n\nArrow keys to navigate · OK to open\nMenu to open settings"</string>
    <string name="airplay_help">"The receiver starts with the launcher. Connect an iPhone, iPad or Mac on the same local network using Screen Mirroring.\n\nOpen the receiver to change its name or pairing PIN. It runs in the background; returning home ensures the service starts.\n\nDRM-protected video is not supported. Multi-room audio synchronization is not guaranteed."</string>
